flowchart TD
    START([Start
    Project + Template metadata + content]) --> A

    A["Step 1 - CATC-GetTemplates (sub-workflow)
    resolve Project Id
    enumerate existing template IDs"] --> B

    B{Step 2 -<br/>Proceed with Template<br/>Creation ?}
    B -->|already exists, skip| END([End: Template Id returned])
    B -->|create or update| C

    C{Step 3 -<br/>Template Language}
    C -->|JINJA| Cj["Assemble request body
    language = JINJA"]
    C -->|VELOCITY| Cv["Assemble request body
    language = VELOCITY"]
    C -->|JSON| Cn["Assemble request body
    language = JSON"]

    Cj --> D
    Cv --> D
    Cn --> D

    D["Step 4 - Create Template
    POST /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/project/{projectId}/template
    or
    PUT /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/template/"] --> E

    E["Step 5 - Get Task ID
    extract taskId from response"] --> F

    F["Step 6 - Wait For Catalyst Center Task
    poll /task/{taskId} until terminal"] --> G

    G["Step 7 - Set Output
    Project Id, Template Id"] --> END
